OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor last to resign from    
OL,4,Acommittee in rapist taxi driver row    
OL,6,FThe final remaining member of Highland 
OL,7,FCouncil's licensing committee who voted
OL,8,Fto allow a rapist taxi driver to keep  
OL,9,Fhis operator's licence has resigned    
OL,10,Ffrom the panel.                        
OL,12,FChris Birt was one of six male         
OL,13,Fcouncillors who decided to take no     
OL,14,Faction on David Brown's licence after  
OL,15,Fhe was jailed in May for an attack on  
OL,16,Fan 18-year-old female passenger.       
OL,18,FThe five others - Duncan Macpherson,   
OL,19,FJohn Grafton, Sean Kennedy, Ruraidh    
OL,20,FStewart and Willie Mackay ` had already
OL,21,Fstood down. Mackay also resigned as a  
OL,22,Fcouncillor.                            
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
